<section class="intro">
  <div class="intro-inner">
    <p class="intro-k rv">01 — The philosophy</p>
    <h2 class="intro-h rv d1">A bath drawn from a single block of stone is not a fixture. It is the <em>quietest</em> object in the house, and the one most likely to outlast it. Each Earthmade vessel is carved from one block — <em>nothing cast, nothing assembled, nothing repeated</em> — and finished until the stone decides where the water gathers.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="intro-foot">
    <p>Fourteen stone families</p>
    <p>One block each · no two alike</p>
    <p>Shipped worldwide · insured, door to door</p>
